{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And he said: Who are these.</b> According to the plain sense, he could not see well enough to recognize and distinguish their features, for it is written, 'And the eyes of Israel dimmed from age.' And what is written, 'And Israel saw Joseph's sons' — he saw but did not fully see; but Joseph he recognized by his voice when he spoke with him."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:02.703820897Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}